Kaleidoscope's Monthly Mystery LGBTQ+ Film\",\"date_release_date\":\"2025-08-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Lumiere and Kaleidoscope are working together to bring you monthly mystery LGBTQ+ films!&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>MAY'S CLUE:<\\/strong> This beautiful, lyrical film was <em>eventually<\\/em>&nbsp;(and rightly) given the Best Picture Oscar in 2017....<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>JULY'S CLUE:<\\/strong> The director of The Brutalist stars in this coming-of-age tale.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>More about Kaleidoscope<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Kaleidoscope is a monthly LGBTQ+ social group for 17-24 year olds. It was set up in 2022 when local members were tired of not having a flourishing LGBTQ+ scene in Romford, and feeling like support and advice wasn&rsquo;t available when they needed it.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Visit&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.kaleidoscoperomford.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">the Kaleidoscope Romford website here for more details.<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1753134906Lumiere_Portrait_Website_1.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1757438615LGBTQ_Film_poster_generic.webp\",\"url_key\":\"mystery-lgbtq\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/mystery-lgbtq?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-14\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"59\",\"name\":\"Kaleidoscope LGBTQ+\",\"short_name\":\"kaleidosco\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/image