          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1160\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Baby Classes with Donna from Basking Babies\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At Lumiere, we are more than just a cinema, we are a community space for a variety of activities.&nbsp;As an example we now host weekly Baby Yoga and Baby Massage classes on Friday mornings!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The typical weekly schedule is as below, but some weeks' classes are subject to change (for example we've started adding Parent & Baby Sound Bath sessions)&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">so always consult Donna's website for the exact class timetable here<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>10am-10.45am: Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>11am-11.45am: Pre-Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>12pm-1.30pm: Baby Massage<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>To book classes:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\">https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>If you have any questions please contact Donna at Basking Babies Romford directly:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>E-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk\\\">Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Phone: 07931 429 634<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604491image_51.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604983image_52.webp\",\"url_key\":\"baby-classes-basking-babies\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-17\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":fa