\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-07-08 02:22:04\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-17\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1154\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Parent & Baby Sound Bath\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-17\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"},{\"name\":\"Meditation\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Parent & Baby&nbsp;Sound&nbsp;Bath<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A calming sensory experience for you and your baby.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for a gentle and immersive&nbsp;parent and baby&nbsp;sound&nbsp;bath, designed to support relaxation, bonding, and calm for both you and your little one.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Held in the unique setting of a&nbsp;cinema screen, this session invites you to lie down comfortably and be surrounded by soothing&nbsp;sounds and soft sensory elements. Using instruments such as crystal bowls, chimes, and ambient&nbsp;sound, the experience creates a peaceful environment where both parent and baby can unwind together. There is also option to seat in comfy cinema seats.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This is not a silent or strict session &mdash; babies are free to move, make noise, feed, and settle naturally. The space is fully&nbsp;baby-friendly and relaxed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Who it&rsquo;s for:<\\/strong><br \\/>This session is suitable for&nbsp;parents and their babies 0-9 months old.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Be sure to bring:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Anything your baby may need (milk, comfort items, toys)<br \\/>And a blanket for you too :)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Take a moment to pause, breathe, and connect &mdash; with yourself, your baby, and others in a shared, calming space.&nbsp;These sessions are proven to provide relaxation, slowing down, and aiding better sleep.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778712342Untitled.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17787124431775163723aaac357f-183d-498e-834d-81798af72fb1.webp\",\"url_key\":\"parent-baby-soundbath\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/parent-baby-soundbath?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-17\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"1h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Crafts and Mindfulness\",\"short_name\":\"arts & min\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/parent-baby-sound-bath-tickets-1990652277549\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15359\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Vk04TWVIY0d6aU92dE9US2ZXeWZvUT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/parent-baby-soundbath\\/showtimes\\/2026-07-17\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=Vk04TWVIY0d6aU92dE9US2ZXeWZvUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"0\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-17\",\"show_time_slots\":\"12:30PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"12.30\",\"time_sorting\":1784287800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-05-29 22:44:30\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/parent-baby-sound-bath-tickets-1990652277549\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-17\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1295\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Rosebush Pruning\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"Germany, Italy, United Kingdom, Spain\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Underneath the Catalonian sun, a rich white American family lives in hedonistic isolation, seeking love and validation through one another, their designer wardrobes and pop music. When an outsider infiltrates the family, buried tensions surface and blood ties are severed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From award winning director Karim A&iuml;nouz, written by Oscar nominated writer Efthimis Filippou, ROSEBUSH PRUNING is absurd, funny and in equal measure.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains sexual violence, strong sex, nudity.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.st