out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-07-02 01:40:30\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-17\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1312\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Too Desi Too Queer - Shorts programme: London Indian Film Festival 2026\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-17\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"UK, India, Bangladesh\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Festival\"},{\"name\":\"Indie\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Too Desi Too Queer Shorts Programme<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This now legendary LGBTQIA+ showcase is back with a fresh crop of inspiring, thought-provoking short films and Q&A discussions. This year, these UK premieres have been programmed in association with <em>Rainbow Noir, Manchester<\\/em>. We have films for all the community, and you&rsquo;ll have your chance to share your thoughts on these films with engaging discussions afterwards, exploring struggles, joy, empowerment, connection and mental and physical wellbeing.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em><strong>Q&A and debate after the screening in partnership with Gay Indian Network (GIN) and other LGBTQIA+ partners.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Warm Shadows (Nighiyaan Chhavan)<\\/strong><\\/span><br \\/>Dir: Aakash Chhabra | 15 mins | Panjabi<br \\/>A son returns from abroad only for his mother to reveal a secret she&rsquo;s been hiding all his life leading to an exploration of longing, memory, and unspoken tensions through the lens of a mother-son relationship.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\"><strong>Ruse<\\/strong><\\/span><br \\/>Dir: Rhea Shukla | 10 mins | Hindi, English with English subtitles<br \\/>On a rainy afternoon, three teenage girls practise a dance that begins to evolve, balancing between innocence and newfound awareness.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">A Thing About Kashem<\\/span><\\/strong><br \\/>Dir: Bijon Imtiaz | 17 mins | Bengali with English subtitles<br \\/>A married man&rsquo;s unexpected bodily reaction, at the wrong time and in the wrong place, plunges him into a midlife crisis, forcing him to confront his identity and desires.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Body of Our Own<\\/span><\\/strong><br \\/>Dir: Rahemur Rahman, Lily Vetch | 25 mins | Hindi, English, Bengali with English subtitles<br \\/>Filmed over the course of six years, this documentary shows the resilience and sisterhood of three Hijra women.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Tara<\\/span><\\/strong><br \\/>Dir: Ashutosh S. Shankar | 23 mins | Hindi, English with English subtitles<br \\/>A Dalit trans woman navigates love and identity after falling for an upper-caste man, forcing her to confront the silence around her caste.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Almari Ka Achaar (Cupboard Pickle)<\\/span><\\/strong><br \\/>Dir: Raakesh Rawat | 20 mins | Hindi with English subtitles<br \\/>In the narrow lanes of Mumbai, two middle-aged migrants from Rajasthan preserve a lifelong love in silence &ndash; hidden behind the shelves of a kirana store and sealed inside a pickle jar tucked away in an old cupboard.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Multiple languages with English subtitles.<\\/span><\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1781302655download_41.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1781302654Copy_of_AKA_1_1_82.webp\",\"url_key\":\"queer-shorts-liff-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/queer-shorts-liff-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-17\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"1h 50m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"81\",\"name\":\"London Indian Film Festival\",\"short_name\":\"liff\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"1\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/12Acert1741549098.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"12A\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16774\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"SHlyenRNU09TYmFCdFdrZmxaR2plZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/queer-shorts-liff-2026\\/showtimes\\/2026-07-17\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=SHlyenRNU09TYmFCdFdrZmxaR2plZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Di