\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-06-20 22:34:08\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-18\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1275\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Lumiere 80s Movie Marathon\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Comedy\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Its time for a flashback with a selection of the best, most fun movies of the 1980's&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This all day marathon features a selection of incredible 90s movies you'll love. The movies however are a mystery unless of course you can solve the clues:<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Actress Geena Davis inspired (but does not star) in this movie based on her iconic window display work in the 70's.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A dip in this pool will take years off you.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Jack Be Nimble, Jack Be Quick, Take a ride on the west coast kick!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>When a city is rocked by crime misfits are recruited to save the day.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Pointy birds, A ointy pointy, annoy my head, anointy nointy!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Dr Brewster tried to seduce several nurses in this unit, claiming to be the throes of an uncontrollable impulse. Do you know what? I'm going to give every nurse on this floor an electric cattle prod and instruct them to just zap them in his badubies!<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778875923IMG_0935.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778875921IMG_0936.webp\",\"u