null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-07-11 17:13:55\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.tickettailor.com\\/events\\/shakennotstirred\\/2184648\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-18\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1313\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"All About Weddings (\\\"Biye Fiye\\u00a0Niye\\\"): London Indian Film Festival 2026\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-18\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"India\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Romance\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Singer-composer Neel Dutt&rsquo;s directorial debut revisits the enduring wedding genre by following the Bengali nuptials of Sromona and Rohan, as they bring friends, relatives, and exes under one roof. This sharp ensemble drama peels back the spectacle of celebration to reveal a web of lies, fractures, and quiet disappointments. Witty and emotionally grounded, it offers a contemporary portrait of love, identity, and societal expectation.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The film premiered in Paris at the Gange Sur Seine 2025, where it won a Special Jury Award.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Bengali language with English subtitles.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em><strong>In partnership with Baithak UK and Bengal Heritage Foundation.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1781303281download_41.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1781303276Pic_2.webp\",\"url_key\":\"liff-all-about-weddings\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/liff-all-about-weddings?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-18\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\