 intimate first-hand testimony from across the globe, Alan Owen uncovers the devastating legacy of more than 2,000 nuclear weapons tests - launching a legal battle that could expose decades of government injustice.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains brief strong injury detail.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>\\\"A powerful and emotional reminder about the sacrifices made by these&nbsp;veterans and the long-lasting impact that it has had on them and their&nbsp;families.&rdquo;<\\/em> <br \\/>- Emma Lewell Buck, MP.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>There will be introductions before, and a Q&A after the screening.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Please note: 50% of the ticket sales from this event will go to LABRATS who represent nuclear veterans, atomic veterans, scientists, civilians, and their families across the world who have been affected by the Atomic\\/Nuclear Testing program.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1772412374POSTER_v6.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17793117268e9a4ff2-44cb-4920-ab6d-d264fc9e0812.webp\",\"url_key\":\"our-planet-the-people-my-blood\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/our-planet-the-people-my-blood?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-19\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DRWPYH1clQg\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DRWPYH1clQg\",\"duration\":\"1h 24m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Daniel Everitt-Lock\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"5\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/15cert1741549310.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"15\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricte