ountries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>EVIL DEAD BURN unleashes the franchise&rsquo;s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>After the loss of her husband, a woman seeks solace with her in-laws in their secluded family home. As one by one they are transformed into Deadites&mdash;turning the gathering into a family reunion from hell&mdash;she comes to discover that the vows she took in life live on... even in death.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Strong bloody violence, gore<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/syGSQh7bqPHCFRhwHewHdR5EqjD.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/69YpigMTzTGurePS8LxMxc0XM0R.webp\",\"url_key\":\"evil-dead-burn-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/evil-dead-burn-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-19\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=nMzhf6qYJ4I\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"nMzhf6qYJ4I\",\"duration\":\"2h 20m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Souheila Yacoub\"},{\"actor\":\"Tandi Wright\"},{\"actor\":\"Hunter Doohan\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"S\\u00e9bastien Vani\\u010dek\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":