"synopsis\":\"<p>Underneath the Catalonian sun, a rich white American family lives in hedonistic isolation, seeking love and validation through one another, their designer wardrobes and pop music. When an outsider infiltrates the family, buried tensions surface and blood ties are severed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From award winning director Karim A&iuml;nouz, written by Oscar nominated writer Efthimis Filippou, ROSEBUSH PRUNING is absurd, funny and in equal measure.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">Contains sexual violence, strong sex, nudity.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/rEn0kHtZAjb44R2Jv0FUBLdFPsY.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/ztIGaREYM9DYqPchm2akfi11SLW.webp\",\"url_key\":\"rosebush-pruning-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/rosebush-pruning-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-19\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=rmHD9gZbF7A\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"rmHD9gZbF7A\",\"duration\":\"1h 55m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Callum Turner\"},{\"actor\":\"Riley Keough\"},{\"actor\":\"Jamie Bell\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Karim A\\u00efnouz\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to res