iere members, please ring the cinema to get the special discount code when booking via Eventbrite; however we do advise members to just pay at the door as you'll save on the booking fee.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1782917602IMG_7523.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1772365912attachment-Movie-Quote-Quiz-feat.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-back-row-picture-show-film-quiz-at-lumiere\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-back-row-picture-show-film-quiz-at-lumiere?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-20\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"104\",\"name\":\"Quiz Night at Lumiere\",\"short_name\":\"quiz night\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/the-back-row-picture-show-film-quiz-tickets-1992566048690\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15873\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"Lzh2N1BSb2h6WkNOWkV2c1lVT3NDdz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-back-row-picture-show-film-quiz-at-lumiere\\/showtimes\\/2026-07-20\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=Lzh2N1BSb2h6WkNOWkV2c1lVT3N