          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1274\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-01\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United States of America\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Comedy\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>A rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">very mild comic violence, threat, rude humour<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778875864download_13.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778875863download_14.webp\",\"url_key\":\"minions-monsters\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/minions-monsters?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-23\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=drr0on3W0K8\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"drr0on3W0K8\",\"duration\":\"1h 50m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Pierre Coffin\"},{\"actor\":\"Trey Parker\"},{\"actor\":\"Allison Janney\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Pierre Coffin\"}],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"2\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/Ucert1741549224.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"U\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_