          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1060\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Toddler Time: Revolting Rhymes\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-24\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Two back to back episodes!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Two half-hour animated films based on the much-loved rhymes written by Roald Dahl and illustrated by Quentin Blake. Revolting Rhymes takes the classic fairy tales of Little Red Riding Hood, Snow White, The Three Little Pigs, Jack and the Beanstalk and Cinderella, then mixes them together and serves them with a mischievous twist!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Please note tickets for Toddler Time are free for toddlers when accompanied by a paying parent or carer. You will need to purchase tickets in-person at the cinema rather than online.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770948919revolting1.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770948919revolting.webp\",\"url_key\":\"toddler-time-revolting-rhymes\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/toddler-time-revolting-rhymes?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-24\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/516276774\\/bbb4d6b03a\",\"trailer_type\":\"2\",\"trailer_id\":\"516276774\\/bbb4d6b03a\",\"duration\":\"1h 10m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"103\",\"name\":\"Toddler Time\",\"short_name\":\"toddler\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"11769\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dVgxQUEwYUZVT1FnMFNmWUtxRTdJZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/toddler-time-revolting-rhymes\\/showtimes\\/2026-07-24\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=dVgxQUEwYUZVT1FnMFNmWUtxRTdJZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 3\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-24\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1784883600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-02-13 02:33:06\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-24\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1160\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Baby Classes with Donna from Basking Babies\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At Lumiere, we are more than just a cinema, we are a community space for a variety of activities.&nbsp;As an example we now host weekly Baby Yoga and Baby Massage classes on Friday mornings!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The typical weekly schedule is as below, but some weeks' classes are subject to change (for example we've started adding Parent & Baby Sound Bath sessions)&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">so always consult Donna's website for the exact class timetable here<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>10am-10.45am: Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>11am-11.45am: Pre-Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>12pm-1.30pm: Baby Massage<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>To book classes:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\">https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>If you have any questions please contact Donna at Basking Babies Romford directly:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>E-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk\\\">Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Phone: 07931 429 634<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604491image_51.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604983image_52.webp\",\"url_key\":\"baby-classes-basking-babies\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-24\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Craf