          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1060\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Toddler Time: Revolting Rhymes\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-24\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Two back to back episodes!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Two half-hour animated films based on the much-loved rhymes written by Roald Dahl and illustrated by Quentin Blake. Revolting Rhymes takes the classic fairy tales of Little Red Riding Hood, Snow White, The Three Little Pigs, Jack and the Beanstalk and Cinderella, then mixes them together and serves them with a mischievous twist!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Please note tickets for Toddler Time are free for toddlers when accompanied by a paying parent or carer. You will need to purchase tickets in-person at the cinema rather than online.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770948919revolting1.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770948919revolting.webp\",\"url_key\":\"toddler-time-revolting-rhymes\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/toddler-time-revolting-rhymes?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-25\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/516276774\\/bbb4d6b03a\",\"trailer_type\":\"2\",\"trailer_id\":\"516276774\\/bbb4d6b03a\",\"duration\":\"1h 10m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"103\",\"name\":\"Toddler Time\",\"short_name\":\"toddler\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"11770\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"TndENUc2UHN1QXNzbVFYL29lNTJvUT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/toddler-time-revolting-rhymes\\/showtimes\\/2026-07-25\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=TndENUc2UHN1QXNzbVFYL29lNTJvUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 3\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-25\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1784970000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-02-13 02:33:27\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-25\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1273\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Mystery Giallo Marathon Day Volume 3\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Our Mystery Marathon Day's Return with Mystery Giallo Day<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>5 Giallo movies from across the passage of time, these movies are imporant key films that helped make the genre what it is.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For those unfamiliar with the term Giallo, these movies are essentially Italian who-dunnit's very much in the vein of Agatha Christie, but generally with a lot more suspence and a lot more blood.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>All 5 movies are key titles, no turkey's here, you're in for a wild riide.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>There will be a 15 minute break between each movie to allow you time to get refreshments.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778874314IMG_0932.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778874314IMG_0934.webp\",\"url_key\":\"giallo3\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/giallo3?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-25\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"10h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false