            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1060\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Toddler Time: Revolting Rhymes\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-07-24\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Animation\"},{\"name\":\"Family\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Two back to back episodes!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Two half-hour animated films based on the much-loved rhymes written by Roald Dahl and illustrated by Quentin Blake. Revolting Rhymes takes the classic fairy tales of Little Red Riding Hood, Snow White, The Three Little Pigs, Jack and the Beanstalk and Cinderella, then mixes them together and serves them with a mischievous twist!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Please note tickets for Toddler Time are free for toddlers when accompanied by a paying parent or carer. You will need to purchase tickets in-person at the cinema rather than online.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770948919revolting1.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770948919revolting.webp\",\"url_key\":\"toddler-time-revolting-rhymes\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/toddler-time-revolting-rhymes?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-26\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/516276774\\/bbb4d6b03a\",\"trailer_type\":\"2\",\"trailer_id\":\"516276774\\/bbb4d6b03a\",\"duration\":\"1h 10m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"103\",\"name\":\"Toddler Time\",\"short_name\":\"toddler\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"4\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/PGcert1741549154.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"PG\",\"movie_certification_descrip