          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1160\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Baby Classes with Donna from Basking Babies\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At Lumiere, we are more than just a cinema, we are a community space for a variety of activities.&nbsp;As an example we now host weekly Baby Yoga and Baby Massage classes on Friday mornings!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The typical weekly schedule is as below, but some weeks' classes are subject to change (for example we've started adding Parent & Baby Sound Bath sessions)&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">so always consult Donna's website for the exact class timetable here<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>10am-10.45am: Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>11am-11.45am: Pre-Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>12pm-1.30pm: Baby Massage<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>To book classes:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\">https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>If you have any questions please contact Donna at Basking Babies Romford directly:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>E-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk\\\">Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Phone: 07931 429 634<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604491image_51.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604983image_52.webp\",\"url_key\":\"baby-classes-basking-babies\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-28\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Crafts and Mindfulness\",\"short_name\":\"arts & min\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"92\",\"name\":\"Baby classes\",\"short_name\":\"baby class\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15363\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"TGFMeGQvTGtOQy9kQjJLRndFek1HZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies\\/showtimes\\/2026-07-28\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=TGFMeGQvTGtOQy9kQjJLRndFek1HZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"0\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-28\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1785229200,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-05-31 19:22:56\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-07-28\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1047\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Well Socials - Being Creative with Other People\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-02-07\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>A monthly event for those who want to be creative with other people!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Well Socials is our monthly get-together for anyone who likes to be creative and meet new people.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Come along to relax, make, chat, and share ideas in a friendly, welcoming space. We&rsquo;ll have some basic art materials available, and you&rsquo;re more than welcome to bring along something you&rsquo;re already working on.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Whether you just want to doodle, want opinions on something you're working on, or just want to be around other creative people and get inspired - everyone is welcome.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>Keeping it Well Social!<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The &pound;5 contribution pays for minimal overhead costs at community cinema, Lumiere Romford.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The cinema has refreshments, hot drinks and food available.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Click the Buy Tickets link to get your ticket.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770499730well_socials.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1770499730well_socials2.webp\",\"url_key\":\"well-socials\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/well-socials?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-28\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Well Social CIC\"}],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Crafts and Mindfulness\",\"short_name\":\"arts & min\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/well-socials-a-place-to-be-creative-and-social-tickets-1982427772834\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16519\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"cjVSNXNiZVJXNklsZjZndW9ibitCUT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/well-socials\\/showtimes\\/2026-07-28\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=cjVSNXNiZVJXNklsZjZndW9ibitCUT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"1\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-07-28\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:00PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.00\",\"time_sorting\":1785258000,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Me