\\r\\n<li>This woman takes revenge on those that&nbsp;took out her brother. \\\"You can't do this! You can't do that!\\\"n<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>This woman will need an exorcist to rid her of her demons after her sister is killed by thugs.&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Two women take a road trip to find themselves, in doing so going truly rogue.&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>A mute woman takes to the streets after being assaulted twice on the same day.&nbsp;<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be a short break between each movie<\\/span>.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1780223448IMG_4317.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1780222969IMG_4316.webp\",\"url_key\":\"women\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/women?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-01\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"12h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your ticke