An English bon-vivant osteopath is enchanted with a young exotic dancer and invites her to live with him. He serves as friend and mentor, and through his contacts and parties she and her friend meet and date members of the Conservative Party. Eventually a scandal occurs when her affair with the Minister of War goes public, threatening their lifestyles and their freedom.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/30hZ9Yn7q7OSTrnBQAXggs011VQ.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/aj8rvZiE0WkqeDEY02bVnuxGVSR.webp\",\"url_key\":\"scandal-1989\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/scandal-1989?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-02\",\"imdb_rate\":\"6.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 15m\",\"movie_year\":\"1989\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"John Hurt\"},{\"actor\":\"Joanne Whalley\"},{\"actor\":\"Bridget Fonda\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Michael Caton-Jones\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16754\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"M0huYnNvTG1HOE45bmZpQ3dhY2lXQT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\