Indie\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>The prequel to National Film Award-winning Lucas and Albert, this special screening of&nbsp;Tales of the Underworld&nbsp;(nominated for Best Independent Feature at the 2026 National Film Awards) will include an introduction and Q&A with the filmmakers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Told through the eyes of a journalist digging too deep, Tales of the Underworld exposes a ruthless criminal empire where missing men, police informants, and shifting loyalties make survival a dangerous game.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Starring: Ian Burfield&nbsp;(Hijack, Who Is Erin Carter, Coronation Street), Oliver Cotton&nbsp;(The Last Duel, Wonder Woman 1984, Killing Eve), Brendan Gibson&nbsp;(Peaky Blinders, Mr&nbsp;Selfridge, Lockwood & Co.)&nbsp;and&nbsp;Cassandra French&nbsp;(Lucas and Albert, Stages, Finding My Voice).<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>18:45 doors<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>19:15 - intro from the production team<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>19:30 - film begins<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>21:15 - film ends, Q&A starts<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p><em>Cert: 15 (contains strong language, drug references, suicide references)<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>Following the special screening, the film will also have a week's run (without special Q&A) at Lumiere. <strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tales-of-the-underworld-2026\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Click here for dates and tickets.<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123852TOTU_2024_Poster_CORRECT-c-1783418973-1595.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123851TOTU_Landscape_Poster_2026-c-1783418973-8165.webp\",\"url_key\":\"tales-of-the-underworld-2026-special-screening\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tales-of-the-underworld-2026-special-screening?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-15\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"traile