          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1160\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Baby Classes with Donna from Basking Babies\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>At Lumiere, we are more than just a cinema, we are a community space for a variety of activities.&nbsp;As an example we now host weekly Baby Yoga and Baby Massage classes on Friday mornings!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The typical weekly schedule is as below, but some weeks' classes are subject to change (for example we've started adding Parent & Baby Sound Bath sessions)&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">so always consult Donna's website for the exact class timetable here<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>10am-10.45am: Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>11am-11.45am: Pre-Crawling baby yoga<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>12pm-1.30pm: Baby Massage<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>To book classes:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\\\">https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>If you have any questions please contact Donna at Basking Babies Romford directly:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>E-mail:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"mailto:Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk\\\">Donna@baskingbabies.co.uk<\\/a><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Phone: 07931 429 634<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604491image_51.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1775604983image_52.webp\",\"url_key\":\"baby-classes-basking-babies\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Crafts and Mindfulness\",\"short_name\":\"arts & min\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"92\",\"name\":\"Baby classes\",\"short_name\":\"baby class\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15087\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"dFErUTE3WjVPUEtEMXJJMUZDQS91Zz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/baby-classes-basking-babies\\/showtimes\\/2026-08-21\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=dFErUTE3WjVPUEtEMXJJMUZDQS91Zz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"0\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"show_time_slots\":\"10:00AM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"10.00\",\"time_sorting\":1787302800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-05-19 11:24:27\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.baskingbabies.co.uk\\/romford\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-08-21\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1154\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Parent & Baby Sound Bath\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-04-17\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Arts and Crafts\"},{\"name\":\"Meditation\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Parent & Baby&nbsp;Sound&nbsp;Bath<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>A calming sensory experience for you and your baby.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Join us for a gentle and immersive&nbsp;parent and baby&nbsp;sound&nbsp;bath, designed to support relaxation, bonding, and calm for both you and your little one.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Held in the unique setting of a&nbsp;cinema screen, this session invites you to lie down comfortably and be surrounded by soothing&nbsp;sounds and soft sensory elements. Using instruments such as crystal bowls, chimes, and ambient&nbsp;sound, the experience creates a peaceful environment where both parent and baby can unwind together. There is also option to seat in comfy cinema seats.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>This is not a silent or strict session &mdash; babies are free to move, make noise, feed, and settle naturally. The space is fully&nbsp;baby-friendly and relaxed.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Who it&rsquo;s for:<\\/strong><br \\/>This session is suitable for&nbsp;parents and their babies 0-9 months old.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Be sure to bring:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Anything your baby may need (milk, comfort items, toys)<br \\/>And a blanket for you too :)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Take a moment to pause, breathe, and connect &mdash; with yourself, your baby, and others in a shared, calming space.&nbsp;These sessions are proven to provide relaxation, slowing down, and aiding better sleep.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778712342Untitled.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17787124431775163723aaac357f-183d-498e-834d-81798af72fb1.webp\",\"url_key\":\"parent-baby-soundbath\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/parent-baby-soundbath?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"1h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"63\",\"name\":\"Arts, Crafts and Mindfulness\",\"short_name\":\"arts & min\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/parent-baby-sound-bath-tickets-1990652277549\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15360\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"bnlpYXFYSzh5QnZDSzdCNmNHNno0dz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/parent-baby-soundbath\\/showtimes\\/2026-08-21\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=bnlpYXFYSzh5QnZDSzdCNmNHNno0dz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"0\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 6\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"show_time_slots\":\"12:30PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"12.30\",\"time_sorting\":1787311800,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_restrict_free_access\":false,\"subscriber_restrict_message\":null,\"show_time_created_at\":\"2026-05-29 22:46:22\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.eventbrite.co.uk\\/e\\/parent-baby-sound-bath-tickets-1990652277549\",\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"1\",\"seat_plan_status\":\"1\"}],\"nearest_show_times_date\":\"2026-08-21\"},{\"movie_id\":\"1358\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Tales of the Underworld\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Crime\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Indie\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>There will be a special screening of the film with live Q&A with the filmmakers on Saturday 15th August.&nbsp;<\\/strong><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tales-of-the-underworld-2026-special-screening\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Click here for more information and tickets<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The prequel to National Film Award-winning Lucas and Albert, this special screening of Tales of the Underworld (nominated for Best Independent Feature at the 2026 National Film Awards) will include an introduction and Q&A with the filmmakers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Told through the eyes of a journalist digging too deep, Tales of the Underworld exposes a ruthless criminal empire where missing men, police informants, and shifting loyalties make survival a dangerous game.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Starring: Ian Burfield (Hijack, Who Is Erin Carter, Coronation Street), Oliver Cotton (The Last Duel, Wonder Woman 1984, Killing Eve), Brendan Gibson (Peaky Blinders, Mr Selfridge, Lockwood & Co.) and Cassandra French (Lucas and Albert, Stages, Finding My Voice).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cert: 15 (contains strong language, drug references, suicide references)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123852TOTU_2024_Poster_CORRECT.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123851TOTU_Landscape_Poster_2026.webp\",\"url_key\":\"tales-of-the-underworld-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tales-of-the-underworld-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=IX2PH7QENIM\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"IX2PH7QENIM\",\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Oliver Cotton\"},{\"actor\":\"Ian Burfield\"},{\"actor\":\"Brendan Gibson\"},{\"actor\":\"Cassandra French\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Darren S. Cook\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"60\",\"name\":\"Indie cinema\",\"short_name\":\"indie\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"