          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1356\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Rise of the Footsoldier: All Day Marathon\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-08-22\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Action\"},{\"name\":\"Crime\"},{\"name\":\"Gangster\"},{\"name\":\"Thriller\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>Join us for a full&nbsp;day of Rise of the Footsoldier, charting all 6&nbsp;films ahead of the release of 'Rise of the Footsoldier: Retribution'.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>For showtimes and tickets for the new installment 'Retribution', <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/rise-of-the-footsoldier-retribution-2026\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">click here<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">The Footsoldier feast includes:<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Rise of the Footsoldier (2007, 130 min)<\\/strong><br \\/>Carlton Leach starts off as a football hooligan, but soon gets involved into various criminal aspects and becomes one of the most feared criminals in Great Britain.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Rise of the Footsoldier Part II: Reign of the General&nbsp;(2015, 111 min)<\\/strong><br \\/>On a quest for vengeance, Carlton Leach works his way into the criminal underworld but the power he gains proves too addictive.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Rise of the Footsoldier: The Pat Tate Story&nbsp;(2017, 99 min)<\\/strong><br \\/>Notorious gangster, Pat Tate, rises through the ranks of Essex's criminal underworld.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Rise of the Footsoldier: Marbella&nbsp;(2019, 85 min)<\\/strong><br \\/>Fresh out of prison, Pat Tate seeks revenge from the man who put him away.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Rise of the Footsoldier: Origins&nbsp;(2021, 107 min)<\\/strong><br \\/>The origin story of how Tucker, Rolfie and Pat Tate unite to form their own firm.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Rise of the Footsoldier: Vengeance&nbsp;(2023, 112 min)<\\/strong><br \\/>Pat Tate sets out on a rampage to avenge his trusted foot soldier's violent death.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><em>All rated 18. Tickets for each individual film will not be available.<\\/em><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>There will be a short break between each film, and a raffle on the day to win some special prizes.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783119739k8lbsM0Nl0c1Qp7NnARWjS6TTRA.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17831188372080.webp\",\"url_key\":\"rise-of-the-footsoldier-marathon\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/rise-of-the-footsoldier-marathon?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-22\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=urBdBwFSfIY\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"urBdBwFSfIY\",\"duration\":\"12h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2007\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Ricci Harnett\"},{\"actor\":\"Terry Stone\"},{\"actor\":\"Craig Fairbrass\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Nick Nevern\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16702\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"MFdzTlI2aTlYbmNJaXorSzBVY