al-screening\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Click here for more information and tickets<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The prequel to National Film Award-winning Lucas and Albert, this special screening of Tales of the Underworld (nominated for Best Independent Feature at the 2026 National Film Awards) will include an introduction and Q&A with the filmmakers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Told through the eyes of a journalist digging too deep, Tales of the Underworld exposes a ruthless criminal empire where missing men, police informants, and shifting loyalties make survival a dangerous game.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Starring: Ian Burfield (Hijack, Who Is Erin Carter, Coronation Street), Oliver Cotton (The Last Duel, Wonder Woman 1984, Killing Eve), Brendan Gibson (Peaky Blinders, Mr Selfridge, Lockwood & Co.) and Cassandra French (Lucas and Albert, Stages, Finding My Voice).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cert: 15 (contains strong language, drug references, suicide references)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123852TOTU_2024_Poster_CORRECT.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123851TOTU_Landscape_Poster_2026.webp\",\"url_key\":\"tales-of-the-underworld-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tales-of-the-underworld-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-08-22\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=IX2PH7QENIM\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"IX2PH7QENIM\",\"duration\":\"2h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Oliver Cotton\"},{\"actor\":\"Ian Burfield\"},{\"actor\":\"Brendan Gibson\"},{\"actor\":\"Cassandra French\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Darren S. Cook\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"60\",\"name\":\"Indie cinema\",\"short_name\":\"indie\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"mo