          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1358\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Tales of the Underworld\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"United Kingdom\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Crime\"},{\"name\":\"Drama\"},{\"name\":\"Indie\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>There will be a special screening of the film with live Q&A with the filmmakers on Saturday 15th August.&nbsp;<\\/strong><strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tales-of-the-underworld-2026-special-screening\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Click here for more information and tickets<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The prequel to National Film Award-winning Lucas and Albert, this special screening of Tales of the Underworld (nominated for Best Independent Feature at the 2026 National Film Awards) will include an introduction and Q&A with the filmmakers.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Told through the eyes of a journalist digging too deep, Tales of the Underworld exposes a ruthless criminal empire where missing men, police informants, and shifting loyalties make survival a dangerous game.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Starring: Ian Burfield (Hijack, Who Is Erin Carter, Coronation Street), Oliver Cotton (The Last Duel, Wonder Woman 1984, Killing Eve), Brendan Gibson (Peaky Blinders, Mr Selfridge, Lockwood & Co.) and Cassandra French (Lucas and Albert, Stages, Finding My Voice).<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cert: 15 (contains strong language, drug references, suicide references)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123852TOTU_2024_Poster_CORRECT.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1783123851TOTU_Landscape_Poster_2026.webp\",\"url_key\":\"tales-of-the-underworld-2026\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tales-of-the-underworld-2026?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_s