          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1298\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Macbeth: Metropolitan Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-10-20\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Two of opera&rsquo;s most extraordinary artists return to The Met: Live in HD for Verdi&rsquo;s thrilling take on the immortal Shakespearean tale of the scheming couple determined to seize power at any cost.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Baritone Quinn Kelsey is the Scottish king haunted by the ghosts of his murderous ascent to the throne, opposite soprano Lise Davidsen as the power-mad Lady Macbeth,&nbsp; whose ruinous ambition&nbsp;damns them both.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Met Music Director Yannick N&eacute;zet-S&eacute;guin takes the podium for a penetrating&nbsp;production by Louisa Proske. Rounding out the all-star cast are tenor Freddie De Tommaso as&nbsp;Macduff and bass-baritone Ryan Speedo Green as Banquo.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 1 interval during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Please note: unfortunately there will be no Sunday encore performance of this opera.<\\/strong><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805287762627_RBO_Cinema_Thumbnail_Macbeth-2.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805287762627_RBO_Cinema_Thumbnail_Macbeth.webp\",\"url_key\":\"macbeth-met-opera\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/macbeth-met-opera?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-20\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"3h 39m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Quinn Kelsey\"},{\"actor\":\"Lise Davidsen\"},{\"actor\":\"Freddie De Tommaso\"},{\"actor\":\"Ryan Speedo Green\"}],\"directed_by\":[{\"name\":\"Louisa Proske\"}],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"6\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/file21762743298.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"TBC\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"tbc\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15588\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"ckIxejN3UitsZFk2SXJ5Ni90R2pPZz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/macbeth-met-opera\\/showtimes\\/2026-10-20\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=ckIxejN3UitsZFk2SXJ5Ni90R2pPZz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-20\",\"show_time_slots\":\"6:00PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"18.00\",\"time_sorting\":1792515600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_til