          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1271\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"The Lumiere Halloween Event\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-05-15\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Join us on Halloween 2026 for a day of horror!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Arrive from 9am in time to get your pumpkin latte before the films begin at 10am!<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">The day's lineup:<\\/span><\\/p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>10am - Scream (1996)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>12pm - A Nightmare On Elm Street (1984)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>1:45pm - Prince Of Darkness (1987)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>3:45pm - Messiah Of Evil<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>5:30pm - The Fog (1980)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>7:10pm -&nbsp;Texas Chainsaw Massacre (1974)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>8:55pm - Inside (2007)<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>10:30pm -&nbsp;REC (2007)<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>Please note in order to fit the films into one day, the last three movies of the day will only a few minutes break between each one.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778872744IMG_0928.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1778872743IMG_0928_2.webp\",\"url_key\":\"halloween26\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/halloween26?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-10-31\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"14h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/