          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1299\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Manon: Royal Ballet\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-10-27\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>In the seedy underbelly of 18th-century Paris, money is king. Nothing is sacred &ndash; even love itself can be bought for the right price. A native of this hedonistic underworld, Manon is caught between twin&nbsp;desires when she falls in love with the student Des Grieux. Steadfast and devoted, he offers the&nbsp;possibility of an honourable life. Yet, the riches promised by the world of Parisian society remain&nbsp;tempting...<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Manon&rsquo;s inner turmoil and struggle for survival lie at the devastating heart of Kenneth MacMillan&rsquo;s&nbsp;1974 adaptation of Abb&eacute; Pr&eacute;vost&rsquo;s novel. In this signature work of The Royal Ballet, MacMillan&rsquo;s&nbsp;nuanced understanding of human psychology makes for an unflinching look into the moral&nbsp;degradation of Manon&rsquo;s Paris, while all its decadence and decay are brought to life through Jules&nbsp;Massenet&rsquo;s score and Nicholas Georgiadis&rsquo;s designs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be two intervals during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805306262627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Manon_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805294652627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Manon_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"manon-royal-ballet\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/manon-royal-ballet?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-01\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"3h 20m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"6\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/file21762743298.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"TBC\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"tbc\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"15676\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"VWFiejJSbndnUkgydVVVWmFIQkZ3Zz09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/manon-royal-ballet\\/showtimes\\/2026-11-01\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=VWFiejJSbndnUkgydVVVWmFIQkZ3Zz09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"4\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-01\",\"show_time_slots\":\"2:00PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"14.00\",\"time_sorting\":1793541600,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"subscriber_priority_hour_with_text\":\"\",\"subscriber_priority_t