          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1089\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Friday The 13th Marathon\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-02-27\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Horror\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p><strong>An ultra rare opportunity to see 8 of the Friday the 13th movies in one day!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>See the first 8 chapters of the much loved franchise back-to-back with just a ten minute break in between, a full 13 hours of movies on the 13th of the month.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>From Jason's return, a few times, to his assault on New York City; with appearances by Kevin Bacon, Corey Feldman and Crispin Glover, to thumping scored by Alice Cooper. This is the best way to spend Friday the 13th with us at Lumiere.&nbsp;<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1772229264IMG_3982.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1772229263IMG_3981.webp\",\"url_key\":\"friday13ths\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/friday13ths?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-13\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"13h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"37\",\"name\":\"Classic cinema\",\"short_name\":\"classic\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"39\",\"name\":\"Marathons & All-Dayers!\",\"short_name\":\"all day\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"3\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/18cert1741549184.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"18\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_par