          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1300\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Carmen: Royal Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2026-11-10\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Under the oppressive heat of the Spanish sun, the fiercely independent Carmen attracts the attention of Don Jos&eacute;. She warns him not to fall in love with her, but his obsession knows no bounds.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Damiano Michieletto&rsquo;s searing production returns, casting scorching light on the lust, violence and destructive desire of Bizet&rsquo;s ever-popular opera.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>An all-star cast brings this white-hot drama to life, with Ginger Costa-Jackson in the fiery title role,&nbsp;alongside Russell Thomas as the jealous and despairing Don Jos&eacute;.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Following his 2023 Royal Opera&nbsp;debut, Sesto Quatrini returns to conduct Bizet&rsquo;s electrifying and sensual score.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be one interval during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805298402627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Carmen_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805298402627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Carmen_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"carmen-royal-opera\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/carmen-royal-opera?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-11-15\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"3h 45m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Ginger Costa-Jackson\"}],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",