d and the house is asleep, Clara sneaks downstairs in&nbsp;search of the doll. Instead, she finds Drosselmeyer, who whisks her away on a journey into a whole&nbsp;world of enchantment: fantastical landscapes of flurried snow and glittering confection where toys&nbsp;come alive and the magic never stops.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Peter Wright&rsquo;s production of this festive family favourite sparkles to the wondrous swell of&nbsp;Tchaikovsky&rsquo;s orchestral score, alongside the glow and grandeur of Julia Trevelyan Oman&rsquo;s period&nbsp;designs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be one interval during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805302432627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Nutcracker_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17805302432627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Nutcracker_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"the-nutcracker-ballet\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/the-nutcracker-ballet?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2026-12-23\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=DHDQ0z4Uslo&t=2s\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"DHDQ0z4Uslo\",\"duration\":\"2h 30m\",\"movie_year\":\"2026\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"6\",\"movie_certification_logo\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie_certificate\\/file21762743298.svg\",\"movie_certification_name\":\"TBC\",\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"tbc\",\"movie_certification_description\":\"\",\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"th