          "headersSize": 1656,
          "cookies": [
            {
              "name": "cs_sessions",
              "value": "7f81f6f089efc7c216ac7b2675bf8800652ef7fe",
              "expires": "2026-07-11T18:33:18.000Z",
              "maxAge": 3600,
              "path": "/",
              "secure": true,
              "httpOnly": true,
              "sameSite": "Lax"
            }
          ],
          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1325\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"G\\u00f6tterd\\u00e4mmerung: Royal Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-02-03\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>An earth in ruin. The twilight of the Gods.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Deception leads to treachery, then devastation, when Siegfried is tricked into betraying Br&uuml;nnhilde. Learning the truth of her beloved&rsquo;s innocence, Br&uuml;nnhilde at last returns the ring to the&nbsp;Rhinemaidens, before ordering that Valhalla be swallowed in flames.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>For the long-awaited finale of&nbsp;Wagner&rsquo;s epic saga, director Barrie Kosky situates the rich apocalyptic drama in a contemporary&nbsp;world of dream-like turmoil. Antonio Pappano, Conductor Laureate of The Royal Opera, returns to&nbsp;take on the impassioned, otherworldly music &ndash; including Siegfried&rsquo;s transporting Funeral March and&nbsp;Br&uuml;nnhilde&rsquo;s electrifying Immolation Scene.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>The brilliant cast is led by Elisabet Strid, Andreas Schager&nbsp;and Mika Kares, who together with the full forces of the Orchestra of the Royal Opera House and the&nbsp;Royal Opera Chorus bring opera&rsquo;s greatest journey to its shattering end.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be two intervals during this production.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820568102627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Gotterdamerung_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820568092627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Gotterdamerung_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"gotterdammerung\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/gotterdammerung?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-02-03\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"duration\":\"6h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[{\"actor\":\"Elisabet Strid\"},{\"actor\":\"Andreas Schager\"},{\"actor\":\"Mika Kares\"}],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this_sold_by_third_party_system\":\"-1\",\"third_party_system_url\":\"\",\"third_party_system_message\":\"Sorry, this showtime isn\\u2019t available for reservation. Please contact the cinema directly to reserve your tickets.\",\"theater_experiences\":[],\"show_times\":[{\"show_time_id\":\"16178\",\"show_time_uuid\":\"c1JpaHk0VkxGY1NjanBXUitMR0k3QT09\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/gotterdammerung\\/showtimes\\/2027-02-03\\/romford\\/seat-plan?showtime=c1JpaHk0VkxGY1NjanBXUitMR0k3QT09\",\"theater_experience_id\":\"1\",\"theater_experience_name\":\"Digital Cinema\",\"theater_experience_image\":\"Digital_Cinema_Media_Logo_1.jpg\",\"session_type_id\":\"35\",\"screen_name\":\"Screen 8\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-02-03\",\"show_time_slots\":\"4:45PM\",\"show_time_hours\":\"16.45\",\"time_sorting\":1801673100,\"sold_out\":false,\"sold_out_text\":\"Closed\",\"screen_tags\":[],\"show_times_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":{\"name\":null,\"short_name\":null},\"member_only\":false,\"member_priority_access\":false,\"member_priority_hour\":\"0\",\"member_priority_hour_with_text\":\"Member priority access till 0. Please login to get access.\",\"member_priority_till\":\"\",\"subscriber_only\":false,\"subscriber_priority_access\":false,\"subscriber