          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1326\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Cos\\u00ec fan tutte: Royal Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-02-23\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Spurred on by a bet, two young men hatch a plan to test the fidelity of their girlfriends. What follows&nbsp;is a slippery game of seduction and power, the four lovers plunging into a dizzying world of shifting&nbsp;reality, where truth becomes increasingly unstable.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cos&igrave; fan tutte has lost none of its sting since it first scandalised audiences in 1790. In her Main Stage&nbsp;debut, Netia Jones, Associate Director of The Royal Opera, reimagines Mozart&rsquo;s comedy of manners&nbsp;through a sharp contemporary lens, where 18th-century romantic trickery meets deeply satirical&nbsp;high-tech deceit.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Taking on the roles of the lovers is an exciting young cast led by Louise Alder,&nbsp;Simone McIntosh, Mingjie Lei and Huw Montague Rendall, with Gerald Finley as their manipulative&nbsp;game-master Don Alfonso and Emily Pogorelc as Despina. Thomas Hengelbrock conducts, bringing&nbsp;out the exquisite melodies that underpin the provocative, and resolutely modern, themes at the&nbsp;heart of the opera.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 1 interval during this production.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820615452627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Cosi_fan_Tutte_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820615442627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Cosi_fan_Tutte_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"cos-fan-tutte\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/cos-fan-tutte?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-02-28\",