          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1328\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Swan Lake: Royal Ballet\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-04-22\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Princess Odette is bound by a curse, turned into a swan by the evil sorcerer Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken by a pledge of eternal love. When she meets Prince Siegfried, he is immediately enamoured by her fragile beauty and pledges to free her. But freedom is not promised for Odette as Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers&rsquo; plans.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Liam Scarlett&rsquo;s production for The Royal Ballet brings together Tchaikovsky&rsquo;s towering score and John&nbsp;Macfarlane&rsquo;s picturesque designs to create an enduring ballet spectacle of love, treachery and&nbsp;forgiveness.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 2 intervals during this production.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820792062627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Swan-Lake_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820792052627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Swan-Lake_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"swan-lake-2027\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/swan-lake-2027?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-04-22\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"duration\":\"3h 35m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_na